13	 * and fall within the range its city's region permits (see {@link RegionPostcodes}), with a city of
14	 * no known region ({@link CityRegion}) accepting any 4-digit code. A missing or blank postcode is
15	 * allowed, keeping the create/update contract backward-compatible. An offending postcode is a 400 via
16	 * {@link InvalidPostcodeException}.
